WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.462
Let’s walk through Check session state.

00:00:02.462 --> 00:00:05.625
Use the tracker to verify which session and exercise window

00:00:05.625 --> 00:00:06.950
you are observing.

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:09.787
If the displayed state conflicts with the room, resolve

00:00:09.787 --> 00:00:13.438
the owning White Cell context before relying on later records

00:00:13.438 --> 00:00:14.863
or exports.

00:00:14.863 --> 00:00:17.850
On this slide, the header mirrors the selected session

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:21.850
state, including Strategic Orientation before Move 1

00:00:21.850 --> 00:00:22.050
.

00:00:22.050 --> 00:00:25.625
Use the dashboard and White Cell console for timer-driven run

00:00:25.625 --> 00:00:26.538
control.

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:30.573
In practice, the Game Master verifies context here;

00:00:30.573 --> 00:00:33.660
White Cell remains the owner of move, phase,

00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:35.385
and timer controls.

00:00:35.385 --> 00:00:38.910
Use the highlighted Session tracker area as your visual reference

00:00:38.910 --> 00:00:40.585
while you complete this check.
